    "raw": "Skath Biology",
    "value": "海鳞族生物学"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/description",
    "raw": "A log from Her'Lur about the biology of the Skath race.",
    "value": "关于海鳞族生物学的记录，赫勒尔著。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Skath physiology is a testament to the veracity and efficiency of evolution. The depths of Norkumsgath, their homeworld, is also blessed with enormous pressures and currents that has led to some of the toughest aquatic life anywhere in the galaxy.",
    "value": "海鳞族的生理结构充分体现了生物进化的精准与高效。其母星诺库姆斯加斯深处环境严酷，巨大的水压与洋流迫使这一水生种族演化出极强的韧性，使其得以在宇宙各处生存。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Able to withstand extreme pressures, Skath can reach depths previously thought to be impossible for a species of their particular build. With their natural capability to hold their breath for extended periods of time, it becomes quite clear that they are rooted to an aquatic origin.",
    "value": "海鳞族拥有卓越的抗压能力，可抵达以往认为以其体型不可能达到的深度；同时具备长时间闭气的天然天赋，进一步印证其水生起源。然而矛盾的是，尽管具备水生特性，海鳞族实为完全两栖物种，并早已开始陆地生活。学界多认为这是其种族议会为最大化星际存续而强行推动的进化方向。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "For some reason, despite their aquatic nature the Skath are fully amphibious and have begun living on the surface as well. Many theorize that this is an attempt by their Council to force-start an evolution in their species in order to maximize their persistence among the stars.",
    "value": "然而出于某种原因，尽管具备水生特性，海鳞族实为完全两栖物种，并早已开始陆地生活。学界多认为这是其种族议会为最大化星际存续而强行推动的进化方向。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "With their change to land-based existence there are challenges every Skath must now face: Humidity and gravity. Without a proper mixture of humidity in the air a Skath will suffer exposure rapidly, leading to their eventual death within a few minutes in some cases. To combat this, Skath have created environmental still-suits to recycle their moisture and keep themselves comfortable.",
    "value": "转向陆地生存后，每个海鳞族个体都面临两大挑战：湿度与重力。若空气中湿度不足，部分个体可能在数分钟内因暴露而死亡。为此，海鳞族开发了可循环水分、维持体表湿润的环境适应型维生服。温暖干燥的环境对其尤为致命，人类仅感不适的沙漠，对海鳞族却是生死险境。保持湿润对其生存至关重要。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "They are especially susceptible to environmental factors on warmer and dryer worlds, and a simple desert is lethal to a Skath where a Human might simply be uncomfortable. To a Skath, remaining moist is imperative.",
    "value": "温暖干燥的环境对其尤为致命，人类仅感不适的沙漠，对海鳞族却是生死险境。保持湿润对其生存至关重要。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "As for spawning young: the Skath have at least kept this part of their species unchanged despite the swap to newer climates. Females lay between six and twenty eggs, fertilized by the males during spawning season, which both partners aid in protecting until they hatch. At this point, both are responsible for the teaching of young.",
    "value": "繁殖方面，海鳞族仍保留产卵习性。雌性每次产卵6至20枚，卵在繁殖季由雄性授精，双亲共同守护至孵化，并共同承担幼体教育责任。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/6",
    "raw": "Priority is placed on social and combat skills, both of which are essential to survival among their people. Typically the young reach formal adulthood within only two years! This makes the Skath the fastest populating race in the known galaxy next to the Thelusians (which is of great concern to the Protectorate due to the Affordance Treaties of 2331).",
    "value": "社交与战斗技能被视作生存核心，幼体仅需两年即达正式成年期，这使其成为已知星际中繁殖速度仅次于蚁族的种族（根据2331年《供给条约》，守护团对此高度关注）。"
  }
]